{
  "camel_example": "aliyun polardb DescribeScheduleTasks --region cn-hangzhou --Status finish --PageSize 30 --ResourceGroupId 'rg-000000000000' --PageNumber 1 --TaskAction CreateDBNodes --DBClusterId 'pc-00000000000000' --DBClusterDescription testdb --PlannedStartTime '2021-01-28T12:00Z' --RegionId 'cn-hangzhou' --OrderId 209512530140000 --PlannedEndTime '2021-01-28T12:30Z'",
  "cmd_full_name": "polardb describe-schedule-tasks",
  "cmd_name": "describe-schedule-tasks",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Retrieves the details of all scheduled tasks",
  "description_zh": "查询所有定时任务的详情情况",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun polardb describe-schedule-tasks --status finish --db-cluster-id pc-00000000000000 --biz-region-id cn-hangzhou --page-number 1 --page-size 30 --task-action CreateDBNodes --db-cluster-description testdb --order-id 209512530140000 --planned-start-time 2021-01-28T12:00Z --planned-end-time 2021-01-28T12:30Z --resource-group-id rg-000000000000 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": false,
  "name": "DescribeScheduleTasks",
  "operation": {
    "action": "DescribeScheduleTasks",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2017-08-01",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "get",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "example": "finish",
      "help_en": "The task status. Valid values:\n\npending: The task is waiting to be executed.\n\nexecuting: The task is being executed.\n\nfailure: The task failed and is waiting for a retry.\n\nfinish: The task is complete.\n\ncancel: The task is canceled.\n\nexpired: The task has expired because it did not start within the scheduled time window.\n\nrollback: The task is being rolled back.\n\nIf this parameter is omitted, scheduled tasks in all states are queried",
      "help_zh": "任务状态，取值范围如下：\npending：等待执行中\nexecuting：执行中\nfailure：执行失败待重试\nfinish：已完成\ncancel：已取消\nexpired：超期（即未在计划时间段内开始执行目标任务）\nrollback：回滚中\n\n若该参数留空，默认查询所有状态的计划任务",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "status",
      "options": [
        "--status"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Status",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "pc-**************",
      "help_en": "The cluster ID.\n\nYou can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/98094.html operation to query the details of all clusters in a specific region, including cluster IDs.\n\nIf this parameter is omitted, scheduled tasks for all clusters in your account are queried",
      "help_zh": "集群ID。\n您可以调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/98094.html接口查看目标地域下所有的集群信息，包括集群ID。\n若该参数留空，默认查询当前账号下所有集群的计划任务",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "db_cluster_id",
      "options": [
        "--db-cluster-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DBClusterId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID.\n\nYou can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/98041.html operation to query the available regions.\n\nIf this parameter is omitted, scheduled tasks in all regions in your account are queried",
      "help_zh": "地域ID。\n您可以调用https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/98041.html接口查看目标账号下所有的集群的地域信息。\n若该参数留空，默认查询当前账号下所有地域内的计划任务",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
      "options": [
        "--biz-region-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RegionId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The number of the page to return. The value must be an integer that is greater than 0. Default value: 1",
      "help_zh": "页码，取值为大于0且不超过Integer数据类型的最大值。默认值为1",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "page_number",
      "options": [
        "--page-number"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageNumber",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "30",
      "help_en": "The number of entries to return on each page. Valid values: 30 (default), 50, and 100",
      "help_zh": "每页记录数，取值为30（默认值）、50或100",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "page_size",
      "options": [
        "--page-size"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PageSize",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "CreateDBNodes",
      "help_en": "The action of the scheduled task. Valid values:\n\nCreateDBNodes\n\nModifyDBNodeClass\n\nUpgradeDBClusterVersion\n\nModifyDBClusterPrimaryZone\n\nTask details are returned only if you specify the `PlannedStartTime` parameter when you call one of the preceding API operations. Otherwise, the `TimerInfos` field in the response is empty.\n\nIf this parameter is omitted, scheduled tasks of all types are queried",
      "help_zh": "任务类型，取值范围如下：\nCreateDBNodes\nModifyDBNodeClass\nUpgradeDBClusterVersion\nModifyDBClusterPrimaryZone\n\n仅当调用上述接口时指定了`PlannedStartTime`参数值，会返回目标任务的详情，否则`TimerInfos`为空。\n若该参数留空，默认查询当前账号下所有类型的计划任务",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "task_action",
      "options": [
        "--task-action"
      ],
      "raw_name": "TaskAction",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "testdb",
